  "prose": [
    {
      "title": "Premade transitions",
      "text": "Mantine includes several premade transitions:\n\nTo use one of them set `transition` property to one of these values:",
      "format": "md"
    },
    {
      "title": "Custom transitions",
      "text": "You can create your own transition. `transition` is an object with 4 properties:\n\n- `in` – styles for mounted state\n- `out` – styles for unmounted state\n- `common` (optional) – styles for both mounted and unmounted states\n- `transitionProperty` – properties which participate in transition",
      "format": "md"
    },
    {
      "title": "Enter and exit delay",
      "text": "Use `enterDelay` and `exitDelay` props to delay transition start. Values are in milliseconds:",
      "format": "md"
    }
  ],
